# Optional. Unset by default: the app runs entirely on OpenFreeMap, which needs
# no key and has no usage cap.
#
# Setting this adds a "Satellite" basemap (MapTiler `hybrid` — imagery with
# street and place labels). MapTiler's free tier is 5,000 map sessions a month
# and is non-commercial only; it pauses rather than bills when exceeded, so size
# a paid plan before any event traffic.
#
# The value ships in the client bundle — that is unavoidable for a static site —
# so restrict the key to your own origin in the MapTiler console.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=
